&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide AI Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a credible, empathetic guide for customers who are excited about AI&#39;s potential but uncertain about where to start, building the safety needed to take bold steps forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Internal Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Sales, Marketing, Solutions Engineering, and Customer Success to orchestrate seamless, high-value customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer Sales Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experiment with new approaches and share what works, scaling regional innovations globally.&lt;/li&gt;
