&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;Use performance data to inform design decisions, prototyping, testing, and iterating on what works while rethinking what doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
