&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design, professional services and UXR to translate customer pain points into a reliable technical MVP and a scalable architectural roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners to balance large-scale feature launches with iterative, daily product enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the articulation and execution of the team’s work and ensure the team’s work ties back into high-level business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your curiosity and technical taste to maintain a high bar for quality and experience on the part of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
