&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set long-term technical strategy for the Adoption Group along with other engineering leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, scope, and implement novel product experiences and scalable systems focused on user activation and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, and execute large projects that require involvement from multiple engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an engineering culture of high velocity, innovation, and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen experience as a cross functional engineering leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
