&lt;li&gt;Oversee financial and resource governance, including budget management, program spend, headcount strategy, and vendor/tooling allocations across public cloud and LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the engineering metrics program (KPIs covering delivery, quality, reliability, efficiency, and capacity) to deliver data-driven insights to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted proxy and connective tissue for the CTO and R&amp;amp;D leadership, driving clear engineering communication strategies, roadmap reviews, QBRs, and all-hands forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate engineering enablement by overseeing robust onboarding programs, learning initiatives, and knowledge-sharing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
