&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 8+ years of experience in engineering operations, technical program management, chief-of-staff, or strategy &amp;amp; operations roles, ideally supporting a large software engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a proven track record of driving complex, cross-functional initiatives to successful completion within a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit strong financial and analytical fluency, with comfort owning a budget, building headcount models, and transforming complex data into clear, actionable dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
