&lt;p&gt;We’re building the AI-powered systems that drive how our GTM organization sells, prioritizes, and engages customers. Our flagship internal platform is an AI revenue engine embedded directly into Salesforce that combines predictive scoring, generative outbound, account intelligence, and automated workflows to help hundreds of sellers work smarter across AMER, EMEA, APAC, and Japan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Owner who will take hands-on ownership of this platform and our broader GTM AI systems portfolio. You’ll own the backlog, drive cross-functional execution, and ensure our AI systems are trusted, adopted, and continuously improving. This role sits at the intersection of Product, Sales, RevOps, Data Engineering, and AI—and requires someone who can translate complex technical&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
