&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll achieve:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Revenue Engine — &lt;/strong&gt;Day-to-day product ownership of our Salesforce-embedded intelligence platform: scoring models, account POVs, generative email, contact sourcing, and signal-to-action workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM AI Systems Portfolio — &lt;/strong&gt;Expand and maintain a growing ecosystem of AI-driven GTM tools including auto-outbound pipelines, meeting prep, deal assist, churn early warning, and enablement surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backlog &amp;amp; Roadmap Execution — &lt;/strong&gt;Manage the product backlog end-to-end: write specs, prioritize ruthlessly, run sprint ceremonies, and ship iteratively with engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional GTM Alignment — &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the connective tissue between Sales, CS, RevOps, Data, and Engineering. Translate seller feedback into system improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Enablement — &lt;/strong&gt;Own adoption metrics, build enablement materials, run regional rollouts, and ensure global teams (including localized markets) are getting value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompt &amp;amp; Output Quality — &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain and iterate on LLM prompts powering email generation, scoring justifications, and AI-generated account intelligence. Ensure output quality, tone, and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Model &amp;amp; Systems Integrity — &lt;/strong&gt;Work across Salesforce, Databricks, Workato, and Outreach to ensure data flows are clean, logic is sound, and automations are reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a Product Owner, Product Manager, or Revenue Technology role within a B2B SaaS GTM organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of Salesforce (objects, flows, permission sets, embedded components).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one data/automation stack (e.g., Databricks, Workato, SnapLogic, Airflow, dbt) — you don’t need to build pipelines, but you need to read and reason about them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with AI/LLM systems: prompt engineering, output evaluation, understanding model behavior and limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to write clear specs, BRDs, and acceptance criteria that engineering can ship from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving adoption of internal tools or platforms across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional communication — you can speak to a seller at SKO and present a technical architecture to an engineering lead in the same day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with outbound sales tooling (Outreach, SalesLoft, Clay) or intent data platforms (6sense, Bombora, ZoomInfo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficiency for ad-hoc analysis, signal validation, or scoring model QA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with revenue scoring models (propensity, intent, engagement) and the tradeoffs involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with global/localized rollouts (EMEA, APAC, Japan) — understanding that “one-size-fits-all” doesn’t work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in enablement, GTM strategy, or sales operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Asana, we&#39;re committed to building teams that include a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills, as this is critical to helping us achieve our mission. If you&#39;re interested in this role and don&#39;t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
