&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Engineering Manager to lead a team responsible for Asana’s monetization platform, the systems that power billing, pricing, packaging, incentives, product catalog management, and revenue-critical operational workflows across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
