&lt;li&gt;Help establish the engineering foundations, operating model, and technical culture for a growing monetization platform team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution, prioritization, and technical direction across a strategically important monetization platform area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, mentor, and develop engineers across backend and full-stack domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong engineering ownership, operational excellence, and collaboration across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sustainable engineering processes that balance delivery velocity with long-term platform health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Revenue-Critical Monetization Infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead engineering efforts across systems powering:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monetization platform APIs and shared business abstractions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product catalog infrastructure supporting pricing, packaging, bundles, and monetization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incentives and discount systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Billing provider integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Billing and payment management experiences within Asana’s admin console&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These systems operate at high scale and reliability requirements and directly support business-critical monetization initiatives across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
