&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-quarter initiatives involving Engineering, Product, Finance, Enterprise Technology, and Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams navigate ambiguity, prioritize effectively, and execute against aggressive business timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to translate monetization and business strategy into scalable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve alignment mechanisms and reduce execution friction across dependent organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term business needs with long-term platform sustainability and architectural health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive Technical and Operational Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
