&lt;li&gt;Evolve reliable, maintainable service-oriented architectures that support monetization and revenue-critical workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams maintain high engineering quality through strong design reviews, code reviews, and operational rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve developer velocity and platform usability for engineers building on top of monetization infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
