&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background in scalable backend systems, platform engineering, or full-stack application development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional initiatives involving multiple engineering and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong execution, prioritization, and organizational leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating production systems with high reliability and scalability requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring, onboarding, and growing engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
