&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering, design, and data science to ship high-impact platform improvements.&lt;br&gt;Collaborate with GTM teams and stakeholders to ensure enterprise AI is dependable, safe, and aligned with governance standards.&lt;br&gt;Shape capabilities that enable shared organizational memory, allowing humans and agents to coordinate actions effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
