&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define and own the end-to-end go-to-market strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering closely with the Integrated Campaigns team to drive measurable business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain messaging and positioning&lt;/strong&gt; that articulates how new applications serve enterprise needs and solve complex problems for technical personas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive high-impact product launches&lt;/strong&gt; that generate market momentum, ranging from flagship releases to incremental feature updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Equip Sales and Success teams to win&lt;/strong&gt; by creating high-quality enablement materials, including battlecards, pitch decks, and customer stories.&lt;/p&gt;
