&lt;p&gt;Our work sits at the intersection of every major revenue lever at Asana — from incentives that drive user growth, to the product catalogue that defines how we package and sell, to the core billing systems through which every dollar of revenue flows. This gives the team a unique opportunity to directly influence both product strategy and business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;Engineers on this team have the opportunity to shape architecture, reliability, and long-term scalability of revenue-critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
