&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_a4fb4bdff97c657d-149&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-212&quot;&gt;For this role, the On-Target Earnings (OTE) range is $148,000 - $158,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-211&quot;&gt;The total OTE includes a base salary range of $74,000 - $78,000 and performance-based sales incentive pay (based on the terms of the Sales Incentive Plan)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,7&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-210&quot;&gt;These ranges are a guideline; actual base salary and OTE may vary based on various factors, including market and individual qualifications objectively assessed during the interview process, and the ranges for this role may be modified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,11&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
