&lt;li&gt;Build internal CLI tools or APIs that allow Data Consumers to self-serve infrastructure without needing deep AWS knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end projects, from scoping and design through to rollout, working across multiple data infrastructure teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
