&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering or Data Engineering background - you’re comfortable writing production code, designing systems or working with Data stack. We use AWS, Databricks, Spark, Python, Scala, but care more about engineering fundamentals than specific domain experience.&lt;/li&gt;
